<title>ESTONIA: Estonian share index closes down, Hansa Bank flat.</title>
<headline>Estonian share index closes down, Hansa Bank flat.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The index for the Estonian bourse fell again on Thursday, dealers said.</p>
<p>Overall market volume was almost ten million kroons and the index dropped 0.25 percent to 104.98.</p>
<p>Hansa Bank was the most active listing at almost 6.5 million kroons. It closed at 106.45 kroons compared with 106.50 kroons on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom +3717-22 66 93</p>
</text>
